    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Exhausted after a sleepless night; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Wheeze, cough, chest tightness and breathlessness at night</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations at rest, orthopnea between attacks or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cold or sore throat</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

